CowSwapModule_EncodeDecodeParams
├── when encoding params
│   └── it should produce non-empty bytes
├── when decoding encoded params
│   ├── it should decode targetToken correctly
│   ├── it should decode minBuyAmount correctly
│   ├── it should decode validityDuration correctly
│   └── it should decode appData correctly
└── given a round-trip encode-decode cycle
    └── it should reconstruct identical params struct
